{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RTM \u2013 The Last Days</strong> is a narrative-driven, atmospheric thriller where survival is only the beginning. Will you obey the facility\u2026 or unearth the truth lurking beneath the surface?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945280/extras/d3201f324b1215a631b67f000e817604.avif?t=1761680268\" width=616 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were born underground, raised by the enigmatic RTM Facility, and trained to guard a desolate checkpoint where trains bring in the living\u2014and the infected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Routine is simple: scan arrivals, separate the infected, and follow orders. But this abandoned sector holds whispers of a dark past missing scientists, unknown creatures, and the experiments that should never have been.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you process passengers and explore the decaying bunker, you\u2019ll uncover logs, recordings, and evidence revealing that RTM may be responsible for the very horrors you face. The line between human and monster blurs, and every decision carries weight.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1945280?t=1761680268","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945280/02a09349cc043a492784a08b911624dc9e636a6a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761680268","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945280/961a93cc59cdd61f348693276386e638131a51cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761680268","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945280/961a93cc59cdd61f348693276386e638131a51cd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761680268","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RTM \u2013 The Last Days</strong> is a narrative-driven, atmospheric thriller where survival is only the beginning. Will you obey the facility\u2026 or unearth the truth lurking beneath the surface?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945280/extras/d3201f324b1215a631b67f000e817604.avif?t=1761680268\" width=616 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were born underground, raised by the enigmatic RTM Facility, and trained to guard a desolate checkpoint where trains bring in the living\u2014and the infected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Routine is simple: scan arrivals, separate the infected, and follow orders. But this abandoned sector holds whispers of a dark past missing scientists, unknown creatures, and the experiments that should never have been.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you process passengers and explore the decaying bunker, you\u2019ll uncover logs, recordings, and evidence revealing that RTM may be responsible for the very horrors you face. The line between human and monster blurs, and every decision carries weight.</p>","developers":["SaltRTM"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945280/43bb8db03c2a44a5d1dfc777386d7893f53a46b5/header.jpg?t=1761680268","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1945280/654988/04e34096c00fa3f27ccfd2ae9083ff9c97ed07e6/1751051627/dash_av1.mpd?t=1706292011","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1945280/654988/04e34096c00fa3f27ccfd